---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | VizAI" description="How VizAI handles the information you share with us.">
  <section class="section-dark">
    <div class="container narrow center">
      <div class="pill">Privacy</div>
      <h1 class="section-title" style="margin-top: 12px;">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="section-subtitle">How VizAI handles the information you share with us.</p>
      <p class="micro" style="margin-top: 10px;"><em>Last updated: January 2025</em></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>When you use VizAI services, we collect:</p>
      <ul class="who-list">
        <li>Business information you provide (company name, website, contact details)</li>
        <li>Email addresses for service delivery</li>
        <li>Technical data (browser type, IP address) via standard web analytics</li>
        <li>AI scan results and analysis data</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="margin-top: 32px;">How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use collected information to:</p>
      <ul class="who-list">
        <li>Deliver VizAI services (scans, reports, monitoring)</li>
        <li>Communicate about your service</li>
        <li>Improve our product and methodology</li>
        <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="margin-top: 32px;">Data Storage & Security</h2>
      <p>Your data is:</p>
      <ul class="who-list">
        <li>Stored securely on encrypted servers</li>
        <li>Accessed only by authorized VizAI personnel</li>
        <li>Never sold or shared with third parties for marketing</li>
        <li>Retained as long as you're a client, or as required by law</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="margin-top: 32px;">Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>We use the following third-party services:</p>
      <ul class="who-list">
        <li>OpenAI, Anthropic, Perplexity (for AI testing)</li>
        <li>Email service providers (for communications)</li>
        <li>Analytics tools (for website improvement)</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top: 12px;">These providers process data on our behalf and are required to handle it securely in line with their privacy policies.</p>

      <h2 style="margin-top: 32px;">Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You have the right to:</p>
      <ul class="who-list">
        <li>Access your data</li>
        <li>Request corrections</li>
        <li>Request deletion (subject to legal retention requirements)</li>
        <li>Opt out of marketing communications</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top: 12px;">To exercise these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@vizai.io">hello@vizai.io</a>.</p>

      <h2 style="margin-top: 32px;">Cookies</h2>
      <p>We use essential cookies for site functionality and analytics cookies (with your consent) to improve our service. You can control cookie preferences through your browser settings.</p>

      <h2 style="margin-top: 32px;">Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy and will notify clients of material changes. Continued use of the service after an update indicates acceptance of the revised policy.</p>

      <h2 style="margin-top: 32px;">Contact Us</h2>
      <p>Questions about privacy? Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@vizai.io">hello@vizai.io</a></p>

      <div style="margin-top: 48px; padding: 24px; background: rgba(123, 92, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(123, 92, 255, 0.15);">
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--muted, #c0c2d8);">
          <strong>Location:</strong> Canada<br>
          <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:hello@vizai.io" style="color: var(--accent-strong);">hello@vizai.io</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
